    {
      "bbox": [
        323,
        425,
        1250,
        491
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, On January 21, 1970, Executive Order No. 2 (2d) was issued by the Mayor concerning the awarding of contracts under public emergency conditions and in special cases; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2267,
          "min": -1.1649
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 46,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0068
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 10683,
        "area_px": 61908,
        "density": 0.17256,
        "chars": 177,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 16.57
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        323,
        494,
        1250,
        626
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The Emergency Repair Program administered by the Department of Rent and Housing Maintenance must respond to emergency situations in residential dwellings caused by the lack of heat, hot or cold running water, electricity, effective sewerage disposal facilities, the extensive accumulation of rubbish, as well as other conditions dangerous to life, health or safety of the tenants in such buildings and other persons in or near such buildings; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1901,
          "min": -1.0167
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 80,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0104
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 25814,
        "area_px": 121968,
        "density": 0.21165,
        "chars": 455,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 17.63
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        323,
        626,
        1250,
        692
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Unless these dangerous conditions are corrected immediately, the occupants of these buildings and other persons within the vicinity of such buildings are subject to serious risk and hazards which directly affect their health and well being; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2005,
          "min": -1.1221
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 42,
          "mean": -0.0045,
          "min": -0.18
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 14277,
        "area_px": 61908,
        "density": 0.23062,
        "chars": 253,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 17.72
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        323,
        692,
        1250,
        758
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, In order to accomplish expeditiously the correction of these dangerous conditions it is necessary and desirable to include special provisions for the immediate furnishing of services to correct such conditions; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1642,
          "min": -0.9991
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 38,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0032
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 12884,
        "area_px": 60984,
        "density": 0.21127,
        "chars": 223,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 17.31
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        325,
        758,
        1252,
        867
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Executive Order 73 of 1973, dated January 15, 1973, established procedures for the letting of such contract without a declaration of emergency being made if the expenditure was less than $2,500, and it is desirable to continue such procedures, but not to require such declaration be made if the expenditure is less than $5,000, which is consistent with the recent amendment to the Charter of The City of New York.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.19,
          "min": -1.0607
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 102,
